sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant C as Cli
  participant FL as Flattener
  participant N as FlatNamer
  participant I as FlatIndex
  participant P as FlatPlan
  participant FS as file system
  U->>C: mediatools flatten MASTER
  C->>FL: analyse()
  loop every unit
    FL->>FS: statvfs(unit).f_namemax
    FL->>I: load _flat/_index.tsv
    FL->>FS: scandir(_flat) -> existing inodes
    loop every media file
      alt inode already in _flat
        FL->>P: ok
      else
        FL->>N: name(parts) -> (name, level)
        FL->>P: link / relink / skip
      end
    end
  end
  C->>P: save(plans/flatten_ts.tsv)
  C->>U: summary, confirm?
  U-->>C: y
  C->>FL: apply(plan)
  FL->>FS: os.link(source, _flat/name)
  FL->>I: save()
